---
title: SEO discovery and improvement system
---
flowchart LR
  accTitle: SEO discovery and improvement system
  accDescr: A useful public page becomes readable HTML, is discovered and understood by a search engine, may appear for a relevant search, serves a visitor, and sends observations back through Search Console.
  page["Useful public page\naccurate text and stable URL"]
  html["Rendered HTML\nmetadata and internal links"]
  discover["Discovery and crawl\nlinks, sitemap, robots rules"]
  understand["Understanding\ncontent, structure, JSON-LD"]
  result["Search presentation\nquery-dependent result"]
  visit["Useful visit\nfast and task-complete"]
  console["Search Console\nindexing and performance evidence"]
  page --> html --> discover --> understand --> result --> visit
  result -. observations .-> console
  console -. improve .-> page
  class page success
  class html,discover,understand secondary
  class result,visit primary
  class console warning
  classDef primary fill:#ffffff,stroke:#2c2c2c,color:#1a1a1a,stroke-width:2px
  classDef secondary fill:#e8f0ea,stroke:#1f3a2e,color:#1a1a1a,stroke-width:2px
  classDef success fill:#1f3a2e,stroke:#1f3a2e,color:#f7f3e8,stroke-width:2px
  classDef warning fill:#f7f3e8,stroke:#6b5a3e,color:#1a1a1a,stroke-width:2px
